+  /// moved state, before anything else reads them, restores the joint. An
+  /// empty leaf sits at zero and stays there; a row out of the likelihood
+  /// contributes no term, keeps its latent, and leaves its leaf to be scaled
+  /// with the rest; the offset is data and is not scaled. With every row out
